## Preserve class dataset/actions through designer sync and registry save

Context: Ontology External-tab Datasets and UC Actions were saved correctly from
the entity panel and by the registry JSONB path, but Designer sync and OWL/RDFS
import remappers rebuilt class objects without `actions` (and sometimes
`bridges`), so a later Save to registry dropped them.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/global/js/ontology-design.js
   Preserve `bridges`, `dataset`, and `actions` when syncing Designer → ontology.
2. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-information.js
   Keep dataset/actions/bridges/dashboard on OWL and RDFS import remappers.
3. tests/units/front/test_class_actions_ui.py
   Contract checks that design sync and import remappers retain External fields.
4. tests/units/domain/test_domain_session.py
   Registry export/import round-trip for class dataset, actions, and bridges.

