## Show UC action description in KG action popup

Context: When running a class Action from the Knowledge Graph (details pane
or context menu), the result modal showed only the function label and FQN.
Users asked to also see the configured function description in the popup.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/js/query-dashboard.js
   Accept optional description in openEntityActionModal and render it above
   the loading/result body.
2. src/front/static/query/js/query-entity-details.js
   Pass action.description into the modal opener.
3. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js
   Pass description from details buttons and context-menu data-description.
4. tests/units/front/test_class_actions_ui.py
   Contract coverage for description wiring and modal rendering.

